OL,3,A'Why we think Milton Keynes can be a
OL,4,ACity of Culture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMilton Keynes has often been dismissed
OL,7,Fas somewhere not worth pulling off the
OL,8,FM1 for, frequently by people who have
OL,9,Fno plans on visiting in the first
OL,10,Fplace. But recently, that tide has
OL,11,Fturned. The BBC spoke to four people
OL,12,Fwho have been part of the city's
OL,13,Fevolution and believe it has a chance
OL,14,Fof being crowned the UK City of Culture
OL,15,Ffor 2029.
OL,17,FIn 2025, the city was named one of the
OL,18,Fbest places to live and work in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
