OL,3,A'Why we think Milton Keynes can be a
OL,4,ACity of Culture'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is now in with a real chance of
OL,7,Fwinning the #10m prize having been
OL,8,Fshortlisted as one of four places for
OL,9,Fthe City of Culture contest.
OL,11,FThe shorthand used to describe Milton
OL,12,FKeynes often refers to concrete cows
OL,13,Fand its many roundabouts.
